    "body": "This is the whole file:\r\n```add_newline = false\r\n\r\nscan_timeout = 30\r\n\r\n#custom format\r\nformat = \"\"\"\r\n🎄 ($username@$hostname)in ($directory)(on \\($git_branch $git_status\\))\r\n\"\"\"\r\n\r\n[username]\r\nstyle_user = \"white bold\"\r\nstyle_root = \"black bold\"\r\nformat = \"[$user]($style)\"\r\ndisabled = false\r\nshow_always = true\r\n\r\n[hostname]\r\nssh_only = false\r\nformat =  \"[$hostname](bold red) \"\r\ntrim_at = \".companyname.com\"\r\ndisabled = false\r\n\r\n\r\n[directory]\r\ntruncation_length = 8\r\ntruncation_symbol = \"…/\"\r\n\r\n\r\n[git_branch]\r\nsymbol = \"🌱 \"\r\ntruncation_length = 4\r\ntruncation_symbol = \"\"\r\n\r\n\r\n[git_status]\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n[character]\r\nsuccess_symbol = \"[➜](bold green) \"\r\nerror_symbol = \"[✗](bold red) \"```\r\n(github doesn't support .toml)\r\n",
    "author_association": "NONE",
